{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id635744982"}, "name":{"label":"MTNMomma71ABW"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-13T10:27:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"14545895435"}, "title":{"label":"Funding the page"}, "content":{"label":"While I really appreciate the ability to keep up with my loved one, and have personally donated $25 to support the page , it continues to state that we need to donate to caring bridge again, and that no one from her page has donated. Which I know to be false.  We have her go fund me created and associated with her page and do not want to redirect her support at this time but your developers should really trigger the funding banner to sleep after a donation has been made unless your goal is to profit off of folks who are in health crisis.  #DoBetter", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
