{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37563397"}, "name":{"label":"liz4cps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-11T11:46:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.6.0"}, "id":{"label":"14053588917"}, "title":{"label":"Updates and badging"}, "content":{"label":"I’m constantly missing updates in this app.  For a long time, it was because I opened it so rarely, I’d get signed out silently and stop getting updates. Now I’m realizing you’re not badging the app either. I like how you organize the information and all, but please start badging the app. I get so many notifications that yours get lost in the mix. In most apps, I can just check the badge and know if I’ve missed something.  It’s disappointing that I can’t with this app that I consider important. \n\nI set up a reminder to open the app occasionally just to keep from logging out now, but not having the badging continues to be a real problem.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
