{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id29823749"}, "name":{"label":"Lindami"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-21T16:13:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"13873145182"}, "title":{"label":"Review responses"}, "content":{"label":"It’s very frustrating to read people’s reviews about issues. They have but not to see a CaringBridge response. All the responses seem to request that the reviewer reached out directly to Caring Bridge customer convenien service. Redundant for them, not very satisfying for readers.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id730053919"}, "name":{"label":"Pruiett Posse"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-19T07:28:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"13864697502"}, "title":{"label":"Great Site but Donation button is confusing"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great site however several people who have wanted to donate are getting confused by the large red donation button at the top of the personal page that states donate to Caringbridge.  There are a few different locations on the site to donate to Caringbridge and none for the person unless it’s set up through gofundme.  It takes an additional step and precious time for loved ones to have to set up a completely different site.  It would be helpful if the button to donate on the personal page accessed the persons donation location and not the Caringbridge’s donation location.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id10958188"}, "name":{"label":"mixedmultitude"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-18T08:03:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"13861367395"}, "title":{"label":"Push Notifications = Ads"}, "content":{"label":"It’s so sad and pathetic that while we watch for news on our friends and family, we have to endure constant pleas for money! It’s truly wrong to take advantage of the notification settings to force this donation agenda, as if it wasn’t bad enough in the app!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1309430715"}, "name":{"label":"Knobel8"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-09T18:11:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"13831972585"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome communication"}, "content":{"label":"We were praying and the information came up on the phone. We quickly responded. To let Chris and Corrinne we were patiently waiting to hear from them.  So this is a wonderful way to find out what’s happening to a family member. We will donate to help those who help those that are not able to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
