{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id100845068"}, "name":{"label":"ATxQT4U"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-12T18:18:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13743111799"}, "title":{"label":"Annoying bug on a great site"}, "content":{"label":"As others have mentioned, when trying to catch up on multiple posts, the reader is always returned to the top of the page instead of where he/she was in the list. It makes one have to “load more posts” multiple times just to get to the next post. Why not have a navigation button in the list of posts? A button that says “next” and one that says “back” would be incredibly helpful. The current way is a massive time hog just to get back to where you were in list. Fix it, PLEASE!!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
