{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24991197"}, "name":{"label":"App User in the USA"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-27T05:33:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13681456665"}, "title":{"label":"Makes misleading asks for money"}, "content":{"label":"CaringBridge asks for donations for itself in a way that makes my friends and family think they are donating to me.   I’ve had three relatives donate money to CaringBridge thinking that it was going to me.  Taking advantage of people who are trying to help out their sick friends and family is a horrible thing to do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id669899269"}, "name":{"label":"MyGrainMama"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-22T15:20:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13664360476"}, "title":{"label":"Something changed"}, "content":{"label":"When I first set up my CaringBridge account I was impressed and looking forward to using it. But it is no longer user-friendly.\n\nIf you look at other less-than-stellar reviews, you’ll notice that they’re not really reviews. They’re requests for help. The company replies to these by telling people to ask for help via their help page. \n\nUnfortunately, their help page is practically useless. It fails to answer the simplest questions. Using their chat feature is a waste of time, since it doesn’t understand the most basic questions. After a couple of tries, it says it is turning you over to a human. \n\nAlas, if you’re super unlucky, it tells you no humans are available, but they’ll contact you by email to help that way. That’s better than nothing, but by the time you’ve spent an hour struggling with the app, then struggling with the “help”, you might be pretty aggravated. \n\nThat seems counterproductive for an app that’s supposed to make my life easier while I cope with a life-threatening illness.\n\nNow that I’ve written all that, I’m lowering the rating from three stars to two. The only reason it’s not one star is because I’m holding onto hope that the app will become user friendly and helpful again.\n\nNote to CaringBridge: If you respond to this by telling me to go to your help section, I’ll probably cry.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
