{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id113085209"}, "name":{"label":"Chaux girl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-21T11:56:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"13296483509"}, "title":{"label":"UI functionality issue"}, "content":{"label":"I like the Caring Bridge app for the most part, but there is one aspect that I find really annoying. If the user is on the main page and is trying to catch up on missed posts, the user simply scrolls down to the oldest post they want to see and opens it. However, when the user then returns to the main page, the main page reverts the user to the top of the main page, so that if the user wants to continue catching up on old posts, the user once again has to scroll down down the page to find where they want to pick up reading. It would be a better user experience if the main page remained in place when the user returns to the main page from reading a post. \n\nOtherwise, I find CB is o be an excellent way to keep up with the medical journeys of my friends and family members.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42706674"}, "name":{"label":"J me hello"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-08T13:37:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.0.17"}, "id":{"label":"13241404259"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t access page"}, "content":{"label":"Hi-\nI cannot access my page using app. I have to use links from emails you send. Another friend today said she cannot get on using app- immediately kicks her out.  She was able to use website and try to get on. Not sure if she was successful.  Common issue, or my page have a glitch?\n\nThanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id350614904"}, "name":{"label":"CarolinaSC7"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-03T09:48:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"13218913773"}, "title":{"label":"Change It Back"}, "content":{"label":"Hard to Catch-Up\n\nNow that the app automatically scrolls up to the most recent update every time you close an older update, it’s become very hard to catch-up on older updates because you have to scroll to find where you were after reading each update. It didn’t used to do this. Please change it back!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30456681"}, "name":{"label":"Hatch1951"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-28T07:24:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"13196292238"}, "title":{"label":"Confusion"}, "content":{"label":"A lot of people have not logged in because it is confusing, not simple like it used to be. Do they think they have to pay to comment?\nSent notice to 100 people, only got 46 visitors causing them to text us individually.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1285747648"}, "name":{"label":"a blissful life"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-27T15:51:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"13193616957"}, "title":{"label":"Add an intro section at the top of the page for latecomers"}, "content":{"label":"We have really appreciated, putting all post in one place and not text bombing people. However, as new people become aware of the situation we added them they have to scroll pretty far to find out what the heck is going. It would be really cool to have a permanent paragraph right under our picture that gave the high-level synopsis.\n\nAlso, it would be need to be able to sort by new comments or reactions because I’m noticing that people are commenting on some older posts as they are joining the site late. I’d love to be able to look for the newest comment so I don’t miss anything.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=365726944&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
